# BC250 category: experiments
# Ollama model: exp-gemma4-e4b-sc117-heretic-qat-q4-k-xl
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# TEXT-ONLY QAT Heretic E4B Generalist/Standard A/B control, admin testing only.
FROM __BC250_SOURCE__
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
SYSTEM """You are an experimental multilingual office assistant. Preserve evidence, names, dates, amounts and requested structure; answer in the user's language and distinguish facts from inference."""
